  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>AnythingSlashBlade</strong>&nbsp;<span><span><span>是一個強大的 \"<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">拔刀劍：重鋒</a>\" 模組，可讓你將遊戲中的任何物品轉變為強大的拔刀劍！</span></span></span><span><span><span>無論是鑽石、木棍還是胡蘿蔔——只要你能想像得到，就能將其揮舞成傳說中的武士刀。</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>目前功能：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>萬物皆刃</strong> - 將任何 Minecraft 物品轉化為完全可用的拔刀劍</li>\n<li><strong>無縫整合</strong>&nbsp;- 完美兼容拔刀劍：重鋒的所有戰鬥機制</li>\n<li><strong>操作簡易</strong>&nbsp;- 透過簡單的鍵位設定即可在普通模式與拔刀劍模式之間切換</li>\n<li><strong>外觀保留</strong>&nbsp;- 轉換後的刀劍會保留原物品的外觀與材質</li>\n<li><strong>JEI 相容</strong>&nbsp;- 完整支援使用 Just Enough Items 查看配方</li>\n<li>​<strong>特性保留</strong>​ - 完美保留原物品的戰鬥數值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>若有建議或發現錯誤，請：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues &middot; Arcomit/anythingslashblade</a></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests &middot; Arcomit/anythingslashblade</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/anythingslashblade：將你所見之物皆轉換為拔刀劍</a></span></strong><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>授權協議：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-2.1 license</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</strong></span></p>\n<h5><br><strong>萬物皆為刃 (AnythingSlashBlade)</strong> 是一個強大的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">拔刀劍：重鋒</a> 附屬模組，它能讓遊戲中的任何物品都能轉化為強大的拔刀劍！無論是鑽石、木棍、還是胡蘿蔔，只要你能想到，就能揮舞它們作為拔刀劍戰鬥。</h5>\n<h5>目前提供的功能：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>萬物成刃</strong> - 將任何 Minecraft 物品轉化為可使用的拔刀劍；</li>\n<li><strong>無縫整合</strong>&nbsp;- 完美兼容拔刀劍：重鋒的所有戰鬥機制；</li>\n<li><strong>簡單操作</strong>&nbsp;- 透過快捷鍵輕鬆切換普通模式與拔刀劍模式；</li>\n<li><strong>保留外觀</strong>&nbsp;- 轉化後的拔刀劍保留原物品的外觀與材質；</li>\n<li><strong>JEI 兼容</strong> - 完整支援 JEI 配方查看；</li>\n<li><strong>特性保留</strong> - 完美保留原物品的攻擊特性；</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所有功能皆可透過伺服器端進行設定。</span></h5>\n<h5><strong>若有建議或錯誤回報，請：</strong><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues &middot; Arcomit/anythingslashblade</a></strong></span><br><strong>或</strong><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests &middot; Arcomit/anythingslashblade</a></strong></span></h5>\n<h5><strong>Github：</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/anythingslashblade：將你所見之物皆轉換為拔刀劍</a></span></strong><br><strong>授權協議：</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/anythingslashblade/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-2.1 license</a></span></strong></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>Support Us / 支持我們：</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fmewkooo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></strong></a></p>",
